# Build context for apps/relay/Dockerfile (the RELAY gateway image).
# The Rust build only needs `crates/` and `config/`; everything below is
# excluded to keep the context small and to avoid leaking local secrets.

# Rust / cargo build artifacts
target
target-rust-analyzer
**/target
**/target-rust-analyzer
/release
recipe.json
**/recipe.json

# Node / UI build artifacts (not needed by the gateway image)
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
ui
ui/fixtures/small-fixtures
ui/fixtures/large-fixtures
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Python
**/.venv

# Editor / tooling / CI metadata
**/.vscode
**/.claude
**/test-results
.buildkite
.github

# Secrets and local environment — NEVER copy into the image
**/.env*
gcp_jwt_key.json
.credentials/

# Repo docs / examples / clients not required at runtime
/recipes
/clients
/docs
/examples

# VCS
.git
.gitignore
